{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-14_beg",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-14",
  "title": "抢占舷侧区域",
  "storyCode": "14-16",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-14_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "74d12dc4c7d8768e562e4cf90311a33397663421df2dc14a615e92f115a567f7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直在想，你什么时候才会来找我，凯尔希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜你来晚了点，错过了最美妙的时刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那株最早破芽的花在昨晚枯萎死掉了，但你再看看现在的它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是充满活力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没有看出和之前有任何区别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正是如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它自枯萎中诞生，转眼便如此茁壮——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，要是你也能亲眼看到这个诞生在源石上的奇迹有多好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这片自源石上诞生的花圃，凝聚了特蕾西娅太多的心血。\n除战争以外，特蕾西娅为萨卡兹所探寻到的另一条道路近在眼前。\n可这条路的未来到底通向哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "带博士来看过这片花圃之后，你就开始花更多时间在这里停留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴别塔还有很多事等着你这位议长处理，但连今天的全体会议你都缺席了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在不光有凯尔希医生在，还有博士能帮忙，我偶尔稍稍偷懒算不上什么大事，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我了解你，特蕾西娅。在大事上，你从不开玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士有向你谈起过自己的看法吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有。我不知道你听到了些什么，但想必博士并没有完全支持你的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不会放弃，凯尔希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果这就是解决如今萨卡兹困境的办法，我会去找特雷西斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会将这条路展示给所有的萨卡兹看，我们并非只有于仇恨中无尽轮回这唯一的宿命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希，请先听我说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很清楚这其中可能会隐藏着风险，但我相信你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我在这条道路上走向不可控的未来，请拉住我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你能做到，尽管你总是对许多事缄默不言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果真想实现你所期待的那个未来，我们仍需要争取博士的支持。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在利用源石这件事上，博士......不可替代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但不论最后结果如何......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我保证，那时我会在你身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（威胁的低吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我拉住他了，别叫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，我不会松手，你放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大风在你的耳边呼啸，你能透过破碎的舷窗看到下方的碎片大厦和满目疮痍的战场。\n接连不断的剧烈爆炸随时都会将你甩出去，而现在拉住你的人......是W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你很少见到如此严肃的W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（焦急的低吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在考虑一件很重要的事，Mon3tr，现在别惹我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然老女人不靠谱，但她从不会拿你冒险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然这么危险的登舰任务她都坚持带上你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......想要见到殿下，想要停下这艘破船，一定用得上你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*萨卡兹粗口*。只能暂时放过你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......谢谢。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "刚才——",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才什么也没有发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下来怎么走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我还能听到我背后炸弹的响声。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "定位用的。你就当作爆炸是它的附加功能吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是你也被卷走了，我总得找得到你才行——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对呀！当时怎么忘了给老女人也上一个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不屑的低鸣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给你都是浪费，小怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赶紧想想该怎么走，空心罐头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剩下的时间不多，这破船眼看就要撞上外面那个怪东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要死也得见到殿下之后再死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "在我们登舰之后，你一直很急躁。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？我都留你一命了，难道不是比平常更情绪稳定吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......是因为要见到特蕾西娅了吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我现在既要给老女人当保姆带孩子，还要考虑怎么弄掉那个核心。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我没工夫陪你玩问答游戏。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......是因为担心赫德雷和伊内丝吗？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嘁，他俩有什么好担心的？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "伊内丝对怎么让死人活过来已经很熟练了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "她会处理好的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......是因为第一次和我单独相处吗？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "......不要试图挑衅我。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "如果不是现在，我可以保证你根本没机会问这个问题。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，不要再用一些自以为是的蠢问题来烦我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阴影从金属中浮现，它们无处不在。\n死魂灵，无处不在。\n它已经来到了W的身前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船舱中的影子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也是萨卡兹！众魂的愤怒，众魂的怒吼，难道你能够充耳不闻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船舱中的影子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不该——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，手滑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，你刚想说什么来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你不会是特意来告诉我殿下现在在哪吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n......\n......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "金属撕扯的声音持续不断，整艘飞空艇在怒号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（紧张地把你的衣服钩住）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "飞空艇......在发怒？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "死魂灵......在发怒？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，看来它也不怎么有理性嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能不能趁现在找到这艘破船上能量波动最明显的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里应该就是它的核心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......我不会这招。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嘲笑地看着W）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......等等，我还有一个办法。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "也许我能算出源石浓度变化最明显的方位！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就赶紧！这怪家伙的耐心显然比我想的还要差！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "它看上去可没那么懂礼貌，等着你算完......\n嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，黑影怪，客人给你家送点礼，应该不过分吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小怪物，要是你护不住他，老女人可一定会找你麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（高昂的吼叫）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这边！但是墙体这么厚，炸弹不可能穿透——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是忘了这家伙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按我以前的测试，它可不只是皮糙肉厚而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱紧它，博士！我给你俩放个大烟花！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爆炸的一瞬间，让它护住你全力撞进去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听懂了，小怪物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（兴奋的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就准备好。三！二！一！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“砰”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我有点看不清——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我的头有点晕——",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快......到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我的耳朵好像有点......听不清......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，{@nickname}，现在感觉怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才又摸了一下墙壁，你们好像也不用非要如此精准地撞进爆炸点？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让你白白受苦真是抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（愤怒地挥手）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心点你的爪子，他的小身板可比不上你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Mon3tr，我没事，可以放我下来了......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你“脸色”看起来真差。呵，不用在我面前装出这副样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这点小事，我可不信你扛不住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我在担心凯尔希......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我可不记得老女人有这么脆弱，她——"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "（虽然已经不怎么大喘气了，但好像她的伤的确没有痊愈......这小怪物还被送过来了......）"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
              "speakerId": "npc_10002",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "（低落的鸣叫）"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "别喊了，让人心烦。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "你还能活蹦乱跳，老女人就不会有事......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "如果阿米娅也遭遇了这些......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "听伊内丝说，小兔子在诺伯特区已经对抗过一次这鬼东西。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "在怎么对付这个怪东西上，她比我们都有经验。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哼，比起死魂灵，恐怕你落在我手上才让她更担心。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
              "speakerId": "npc_10002",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "（威胁的吼叫）"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "闭嘴，现在可没老女人给你撑腰。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "小兔子不会有事，我说的。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "{@nickname}，别磨磨蹭蹭了，该走了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "W走在长廊上，不经意透过玻璃望向窗外，愣神了片刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，没时间旅游了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你来到了窗边，看到了下方的战场。\n诸王之息发出的金色光芒仍在天空闪烁，维多利亚的反攻此刻应该正在进行吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "维多利亚的反攻已经开始了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "希望罗德岛的各位能够帮上忙......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那下面现在就是地狱，不用看了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你刚刚......在为战场悲伤？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......死的萨卡兹够多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有很多事，想要问问殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（警惕地张望）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......Mon3tr？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（愤怒地攻击地面）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阴影的黑潮无声无息地自你的脚下出现，以不可思议的速度将你拖入了走廊尽头的黑暗中。\n你感受到一柄锋利的刀刃已经抵上了你的后颈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这里不止有死魂灵——！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（低沉的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑色的潮水将疯狂挣扎的Mon3tr死死地包裹，让其难以动弹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*萨卡兹粗口*，在我的眼皮子底下抢人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（愤怒的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给我把人还回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你看到走廊尽头的黑暗里闪出了一道光亮，随即传来的便是一声爆炸的轰鸣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "从背后传来的冲击是如此强烈，以至于让你狠狠地跌出黑暗，撞向地面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......好痛！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......我背后的炸弹？！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样，能定位的新型推进装置，还不错吧？我都说过了，爆炸只是附加功能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过让你疼上两三天还是能做到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，我们的配合还真是默契！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我没同意过这种配合！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你应该提前提醒我！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不要配合，怎么配合，本来就是我说了算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，躲在里面的人，是不是你也吓了一跳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还是没有什么变化，W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不能再往前了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有你，“博士”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你......是活着的人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我应该见过你吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她想起了自己回到巴别塔的那天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她想起了那扇破碎的大门，那个染血的标记......\n还有那些躲藏在面罩之下的......凶手。\n他们夺走了特蕾西娅的生命。\n那个特蕾西娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "W发现自己此刻无比冷静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一定会死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，会死得很惨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
